{{#> layout
  title="Language Learning Is Hard and Will Always Be Hard"
  url='/language-learning-is-hard.html'
}}
  <style>
    /* Long-form essay layout for language-learning-is-hard.html. */

    .llh {
      max-width: 40rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding-top: 2rem;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      line-height: 1.75;
      color: var(--v-color-emphasize);

      & p {
        margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
      }

      & p a {
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration-color: rgba(var(--v-color-primary-rgb), 0.4);
        text-underline-offset: 0.2em;

        &:hover {
          text-decoration-color: var(--v-color-primary);
        }
      }
    }

    .llh-kicker {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      color: var(--v-color-primary);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;

      &::before {
        content: '';
        width: 2rem;
        height: 2px;
        background: currentColor;
      }
    }

    .llh-title {
      text-wrap: balance;
      margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
      font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 6vw, 3.25rem);
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }

    .llh-intro {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--v-color-body);
    }

    .llh-point {
      margin-top: 4.5rem;
      padding-top: 2rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--v-color-border-muted);
    }

    .llh-point-number {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--v-color-primary);
      font-family: var(--v-headings-font-family);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .llh-point-title {
      text-wrap: balance;
      margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 1.9rem);
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 1.25;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .llh-figures {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      margin: 0.5rem 0 2rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--v-color-border-muted);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--v-color-border-muted);

      & > div {
        padding: 1.5rem 0;

        & + div {
          padding-left: 2rem;
          border-left: 1px solid var(--v-color-border-muted);
        }
      }

      & dt {
        font-family: var(--v-headings-font-family);
        font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 5vw, 2.4rem);
        font-weight: 600;
        line-height: 1.1;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        color: var(--v-color-primary);
      }

      & dd {
        margin: 0.4rem 0 0;
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.4;
        color: var(--v-color-body);
      }
    }

    .llh-habits {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      column-gap: 2rem;
      margin: 0.5rem 0 2rem;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;

      @media (width >= 576px) {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }

      & li {
        display: flex;
        align-items: baseline;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        padding: 0.8rem 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--v-color-border-muted);
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.45;

        &:last-child {
          border-bottom: 0;
        }

        /* In two columns, the first item of the last row is at the bottom too. */
        @media (width >= 576px) {
          &:nth-child(odd):nth-last-child(-n + 2) {
            border-bottom: 0;
          }
        }
      }

      & i {
        flex-shrink: 0;
        color: var(--v-color-primary);
        font-size: 1rem;
      }
    }

    .llh-closing {
      margin-top: 5rem;
      padding-top: 3rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--v-color-border-muted);
      text-align: center;

      & > p {
        max-width: 32rem;
        margin: 0 auto 2rem;
        text-wrap: balance;
        font-family: var(--v-headings-font-family);
        font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3.5vw, 1.75rem);
        font-weight: 600;
        line-height: 1.3;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }
    }

    .llh-cta {
      max-width: 22rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    @media (width < 576px) {
      .llh {
        padding-top: 1rem;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
      }

      .llh-intro {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
      }

      .llh-point {
        margin-top: 3.5rem;
      }

      .llh-figures {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;

        & > div + div {
          padding-left: 0;
          border-left: 0;
          border-top: 1px solid var(--v-color-border-muted);
        }
      }
    }
  </style>

  {{#> text-container }}
    <article class="llh">
      <header>
        <p class="llh-kicker">Active language usage</p>
        <h1 class="llh-title">Language Learning Is Hard and Will Always Be Hard</h1>
        <p class="llh-intro">Deep down, we already know it. That's why we're so surprised when someone we've known for years suddenly starts speaking a foreign language. It almost never happens.</p>
      </header>

      <section class="llh-point">
        <span class="llh-point-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <h2 class="llh-point-title">Language learning requires thousands of hours of practice and thousands of words to learn.</h2>

        <p>The <a href="https://www.dliflc.edu/about/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">US Defense Language Institute</a> teaches languages seven hours a day, five days a week, for 36 to 64 weeks, with two to three hours of homework every night. That's what it takes for students to <a href="https://www.dliflc.edu/?p=32301" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">graduate at level 2/2/1+</a> on the <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ILR_scale" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">ILR scale</a>: &ldquo;limited working proficiency&rdquo; in listening and reading, and a step below it in speaking. To understand native speakers and books without help, a learner needs to know thousands of <a href="https://www.wgtn.ac.nz/__data/assets/pdf_file/0018/1626120/2006-How-large-a-vocab.pdf" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">word families</a>.</p>

        <dl class="llh-figures">
          <div>
            <dt>1,260&ndash;2,240</dt>
            <dd>hours of full-time classes, homework not included</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>6,000&ndash;9,000</dt>
            <dd>word families to understand speech and written text</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>

        <p>Thousands of hours of practice and thousands of words are no joke. It takes years &ndash; that's why so many people give up, and why so few are fluent in three or more languages.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="llh-point">
        <span class="llh-point-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <h2 class="llh-point-title">Successful language learners are active language users.</h2>

        <p>Those who understand the enormous scope of language learning don't rely on apps and courses &ndash; they weave the foreign language into their lives.</p>

        <ul class="llh-habits">
          <li><i class="bi bi-book" aria-hidden="true"></i>They read books</li>
          <li><i class="bi bi-newspaper" aria-hidden="true"></i>They consume news</li>
          <li><i class="bi bi-play-btn" aria-hidden="true"></i>They watch YouTube</li>
          <li><i class="bi bi-headphones" aria-hidden="true"></i>They listen to podcasts</li>
          <li><i class="bi bi-lightbulb" aria-hidden="true"></i>They think in the foreign language</li>
          <li><i class="bi bi-chat" aria-hidden="true"></i>They jump on every opportunity to use it</li>
        </ul>

        <p>They start as soon as they reach a stable A2 level. It's hard, but they persevere and eventually become fluent.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="llh-point">
        <span class="llh-point-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        <h2 class="llh-point-title">Becoming fluent in a foreign language improves your life.</h2>

        <p>Pursuing fluency in a foreign language tangibly improves people's lives. They become more articulate. They find better jobs, better friends, and better partners. They move to better countries.</p>
      </section>

      <footer class="llh-closing">
        <p>Vocably is designed for such people &ndash; for those who know that language learning is no joke.</p>

        <div class="llh-cta">
          {{> cta }}
        </div>
      </footer>
    </article>
  {{/text-container}}

{{/layout}}
